Z||000000||Bluebottlejunky||03-31-2001||12:55 PM||||Can you order replacement clips for the door panel?  My right door panel is missing almost all of them?  Or would i have to buy a hole new door panel?<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>85' GT 4sp||||reg||1
Z||000001||theogre||03-31-2001||01:12 PM||||I think the number for the clips is in my cave. MotorMite Body-Tite # 45815. get them at most parts stores.<P>you have to cut the one for the bottom rear corner of the door or the window will hit it. You need to cut off the smooth point and maybe a hair more. It will make an anoying pop when the wnidow runs it over.||||reg||1
